This product includes third-party data and software, listed below with their
licenses and required attributions. Data listed here is processed offline at
build time by tools/build-geo.mjs, tools/build-flags.mjs, tools/build-gdp.mjs and
tools/build-people.mjs; none of it is fetched at request time.

The ONE exception is the photograph in a "where was this person born?" challenge
(D-78), which the player's browser fetches from Wikimedia Commons as the page
renders. Nothing else in the game reaches outside lisecki.dev at play time, and
site/privacidade.html says so.


