World Bank, World Development Indicators  —  GDP per capita
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Indicator: NY.GDP.PCAP.PP.CD — GDP per capita, PPP (current international $)
Source:    https://data.worldbank.org/indicator/NY.GDP.PCAP.PP.CD
License:   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

    Contains figures from the World Bank's World Development Indicators,
    used under CC BY 4.0. The World Bank does not endorse this work.

CC BY 4.0 requires attribution, a link to the licence, and an indication of
what was changed. The derived file backend/functions/src/data/gdp.json holds one
figure per country for a single pinned year, rounded to the nearest integer;
nothing else was altered. The year is stated in every prompt the game shows,
because the World Bank revises past years and an unstated vintage is an argument
waiting to happen (D-53).


