Pantheon  —  people, birthplaces and how widely known each person is
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:   https://pantheon.world/data/api  (MIT Media Lab, Collective Learning)
License:  CC BY-SA 4.0  —  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

    Yu, A.Z., Ronen, S., Hu, K., Lu, T., Hidalgo, C.A. "Pantheon 1.0, a manually
    verified dataset of globally famous biographies." Scientific Data 2:150075.

Read at build time by tools/build-people.mjs, which keeps the name, the birth
city, the birth year and the popularity index. It does NOT keep Pantheon's
`description` field: it reads "Turkish actor and fashion model" and the country
is the answer to the challenge.


